  "instructions": [
    "In a blender or food processor, combine peanut butter, tagine spice blend, mellow chili flakes, garlic, ginger, lime juice, fish sauce, salt, and black pepper. Blend until smooth.",
    "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add the chicken and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the peanut sauce to the skillet and stir to combine. Bring to a simmer and cook for 10-15 minutes or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "Stir in coconut milk and cilantro. Simmer for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "Serve hot over rice or noodles."
